<title>USA: Illinois direct hogs off $0.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Illinois direct hogs off $0.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts were $0.50 lower. Demand was moderate. Top $53.50 per cwt.</p>
<p>US 1-2 230-260 lbs. 52.00-53.00, few 53.50</p>
<p>Sows - not established early.</p>
